    "Entry wedge": "ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ",
    "Recurring technical incidents and troubleshooting": "Incident ດ້ານເຕັກນິກທີ່ເກີດຊ້ຳ ແລະ troubleshooting",
