    "The answer informs judgement; it does not execute a command or grant production authority.": "ຄຳຕອບຊ່ວຍການຕັດສິນ; ມັນບໍ່ຮັນຄຳສັ່ງ ຫຼືໃຫ້ອຳນາດ Production.",
